:::text id=WtG2BqfbOq at=top-center width=86% height=144 offsetY=24 preset=title align=left
# Common questions
:::

:::text id=-_fQGtW_LY at=top-left width=80% height=64 offsetX=80 offsetY=168 preset=caption align=left color=#F97316
Q · WHEN DOES IT SHIP?
:::

:::text id=6oHlgNrGuz at=top-left width=80% height=80 offsetX=80 offsetY=208 preset=body align=left
End of the quarter, with a beta available next month.
:::

:::text id=s_1W74oPFQ at=top-left width=80% height=64 offsetX=80 offsetY=328 preset=caption align=left color=#F97316
Q · DOES IT REPLACE THE OLD VERSION?
:::

:::text id=Uot7lQpCsO at=top-left width=80% height=120 offsetX=80 offsetY=368 preset=body align=left
Eventually — but both will run side by side for at least six months.
:::

:::text id=KRzTQoFzLj at=top-left width=80% height=64 offsetX=80 offsetY=488 preset=caption align=left color=#F97316
Q · WHAT'S THE PRICE?
:::

:::text id=l8dpSHLo1O at=top-left width=80% height=120 offsetX=80 offsetY=528 preset=body align=left
Same as today for existing customers. New tiers available on the website.
:::
